&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The header image features adorable Rosemary! Drawn by Pixiv artist &lt;a class="link" href="https://www.pixiv.net/users/38336697" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
 &gt;赌上厨师生涯的拼好饭&lt;/a&gt;, here&amp;rsquo;s the &lt;a class="link" href="https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/138994056" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
 &gt;original link&lt;/a&gt;. The track is a Touhou doujin piece I&amp;rsquo;ve been listening to a lot lately: &lt;strong&gt;encourager&lt;/strong&gt;, the first track from &lt;a class="link" href="http://www.rd-sounds.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
 &gt;凋叶棕 (RD-Sounds)&lt;/a&gt;&amp;rsquo;s album &lt;strong&gt;望 (Bou)&lt;/strong&gt;. The melody is positive and uplifting, bright and cheerful. The blonde kid on the album cover is so cute — can you even argue with that!?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>(Maybe) a Git Tutorial? Part Three</title><link>https://a-moment096.github.io/en/posts/shell_note/git_how/git_3/</link><pubDate>Tue, 26 Aug 2025 18:28:16 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://a-moment096.github.io/en/posts/shell_note/git_how/git_3/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://a-moment096.github.io/images/Tatara-Kogasa.jpg" alt="Featured image of post (Maybe) a Git Tutorial? Part Three" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The final section &amp;ndash; let&amp;rsquo;s talk about collaborating with others on GitHub~&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
